===Verb===
{{en-verb|++}} {{lb|en|transitive|or|intransitive}}

# To [[add]] or [[substitute]] new [[part]]s or [[component]]s to some [[device]], [[structure]] etc., that were not previously [[available]]; to [[modernize]]
#* {{quote-journal|en|date=2020 January 2|author=Richard Clinnick|title=Midlands Metro welcomes new catenary-free trams|journal=Rail|page=16|text=Trams dating from 2012 have been '''retro-fitted''' with lithium batteries, with the conversions starting in 2018.}}
# To fix an older [[version]] (or older versions) as part of the same process of fixing the newest version; to [[backport]]
#: {{ux|en|The bug was so bad that we had to '''retrofit''' our patch to the last three releases, as well as the newest release.}}

